# --- Telegram lead delivery (optional but recommended) ---
# Without these, form submissions open Telegram with the message copied to the
# clipboard and the customer presses send. With them, submissions are delivered
# automatically and the customer never leaves the site.
#
# 1. Create a bot: message @BotFather on Telegram, send /newbot, copy the token.
# 2. Get your chat id: message @userinfobot, copy the "Id" number.
# 3. Send your bot any message once, so it is allowed to write to you.
#
# NOTE: these values ship inside the JS bundle and can be read by anyone who
# views the site. A bot token only allows acting AS the bot, so the realistic
# risk is someone spamming your chat. Put a small proxy in front of it if that
# is a concern.
VITE_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=""
VITE_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=""
